Page 42 Part 1 (Dose Esc alation)  
Part 1 will enroll subjects meeting the eligibility criteria set up for any of the 4 cohorts of Part 2 
using a 3  + 3 + 3 design.  Escalating doses of trastuzumab  deruxtecan  (Table  3.1) in combination 
with nivolumab will be assessed.  Trastuzumab  deruxtecan  and nivolumab will be administered 
on Day 1 of each 21 -day cycle.  
