Investigator.  Lesions situated in a previously irradiated area are considered measurable if  
progression has been demonstrated in such lesions  (Section  1.1). 
6. Has adequate cardiac function, as defined by LVEF ≥50% within 28 days before 
enrollm ent.  
7. Adequate bone marrow function, defined as:  
