cancer as per ASCO -CAP guidelines.  Note : Subjects with HER2 negative residual 
disease treated with adjuvant anti HER2 therapy as per standard practice may be eligible.  
13. Has multiple primary malignancies within 3 years, except adequately resected 
non-melanoma skin cancer, curatively treated in -situ disease, other solid tumors 
