Trastuzumab  Deruxtecan  and Nivolumab  
5.5.1.  Guidelines for Delay, Reduction and/or Discontinuation for Trastuzumab  
Deruxtecan  and Nivolumab  
All dose modifications (interruption, reduction , and/or discontinuation) should be based on the 
worst preceding toxicity (CTCAE version  5.0) as shown in  Table  5.1 Specific criteria for 
interruption, re -initiation, dose reduction and/or discontinuation of trastuzumab  deruxtecan are 
listed in the table below, whi ch is applicable only to TEAEs that are assessed as related to use of 
Protocol  DS8201 -A-U105  
