at bedside and monitor participant until recovery of the symptoms.  
In case of late -occurring hypersensitivity symptoms (eg, appearance 
of a localized or generalized pruritus within 1 week after treatment), 
symptomatic treatment may be given (eg , oral  
antihistamine or corticosteroids).   
 
 
