Left Ventricular 
Ejection Fraction 
(LVEF)   
LVEF >45% and decrease in LVEF by 10% to 20% 
(absolute value)  
Continue treatment with trastuzumab deruxtecan.  
 
LVEF 40% to ≤45% and decrease is <10% (absolute 
value) from baseline  
Continue treatment with trastuzumab deruxtecan.  
Repeat LVEF assessment within 3 weeks.  
 
LVEF 40% to ≤45% and decrease is 10 -20% (absolute 
value) from baseline  
Interrupt trastuzumab deruxtecan dosing.  
Repeat LVEF assessment within 3 weeks.  
If LVEF has not recovered to within 10% (absolute value) 
from baseline, discontinue subject from study treatment.  If 
LVEF recovers to within 10% from baseline, resume study 
drug treatment  
 
LVEF <40% or >20% (absolute value) drop from baseline  
Interrupt trastuzumab deruxtecan dosing.  
Repeat LVEF assessment within 3 weeks.  
If LVEF <40% or >20% drop from baseline is confirmed, 
discontinue subject from study treatment.   
Grade 3 & 4  
Permanently discontinue.  
